	"note": "Orca CAD is the Design view of OrcaSlicer, not a separate application: same process, same window, same WM_CLASS. Its tools are dial pages of the OrcaSlicer profile. Sketch tools are single letters and only live while a sketch is open; feature tools are shift+letter. The category is the key table the tool lives in: a sketch-mode letter and a feature-mode letter can be the same letter and mean different things."
